      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "They should actually make it draw like the ad on Quest! Currently, Quest users who buy the pen are being scammed! It looks like the VRChat world pens from 2018 when they didn't know how to make those stupid spikes stop generating in random directions at the ends of the strokes. The PC pen seems to draw as advertised but Quest just gets scammed. I'd expect this false advertising from a Gumroad listing but not VRChat themselves!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
